  "notes": "FORMATION:\n{審|しん} (examine, investigate) + {査|さ} (investigate) → examination\n\nVERB FORM:\n{審査|しんさ}する (to examine, to screen, to judge)\n\nRELATED COMPOUNDS:\n- {審査|しんさ}{員|いん} (judge, examiner)\n- {審査|しんさ}{基準|きじゅん} (judging criteria)\n- {審査|しんさ}{結果|けっか} (screening result)\n- {書類|しょるい}{審査|しんさ} (document screening)\n- {入国|にゅうこく}{審査|しんさ} (immigration inspection)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {検査|けんさ} (inspection, examination)\n- {調査|ちょうさ} (investigation, survey)\n- {判定|はんてい} (judgment, decision)\n\nCOMMON CONTEXTS:\n- Loan applications ({融資|ゆうし}{審査|しんさ})\n- Immigration ({入国|にゅうこく}{審査|しんさ})\n- Competitions ({コンクール}{審査|しんさ})\n- Job applications ({採用|さいよう}{審査|しんさ})",
